sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Worker as Refund Worker
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Stripe
    participant API as Backend API
    actor Guest

    Worker->>DB: Pick up due refunds every 15 seconds
    DB-->>Worker: Refund details
    Worker->>Stripe: Find existing refund or submit safely

    alt Refund succeeded
        Stripe-->>Worker: Success
        Worker->>DB: Save success and update accounting
    else Refund still pending
        Stripe-->>Worker: Pending
        Worker->>DB: Schedule another check
    else Error or failed refund
        Worker->>DB: Record outcome for retry or manual attention
    end

    opt Stripe sends a later update
        Stripe->>API: Refund webhook
        API->>Stripe: Retrieve current refund status
        Stripe-->>API: Current status
        API->>DB: Update refund and accounting
    end

    Guest->>API: Check refund status
    API->>DB: Read refund status
    DB-->>API: Current status
    API-->>Guest: Show refund progress
